CB2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IxU23k0wv0EQ7kNvwFqEnvv&_nc_oc=Adnh38Dtk7i2qZ9eq5YD_L8HbclyK0offUNU1OIioljAaptCVCQF1UPtWYbbv02mY7w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyffo1dQkRl98w2VCFfpP-Rou6Kqor43mA_hIEkgX30nQ&oe=69AC19D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JDBXfe0cZfoQ7kNvwG_sODJ&_nc_oc=Adkpehl8cN2l6sVlDeBRbUu4lvxMiebbXuvl6gNT3vuutG7RKDUDx4SQwf2wHXhG4_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwsK2VXMWoSiqs_V2JlQwp_HLeoA7ZYMOmoB_khXJWkLw&oe=69AC1F15"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ktHUd0X4EQQ7kNvwFby4B2&_nc_oc=AdlQXl3GYGRRtsFQhwrP6Pym7C8AX_TTuoaUch2kUs3tMHr-X6z1hFFD0NPgWPP4VQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwUE1YW0qgaVld2QA6YkJP-am5jWPba9dyHY0jrwcZVIw&oe=69AC32C2"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q-pkx0t1zWMQ7kNvwEGAWmF&_nc_oc=AdlSnt7GE2jxsPaBNR6kPTnCyDntkJyAJapdLCVwNa77ZqS548ycoCAbQ0G3e14Djic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwRMdR4tgoLSt8mcdEThoqkgyAnGAOq-xWlzhvJH4RRlg&oe=69AC1944"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B0v2QHH4N_EQ7kNvwE6vyCm&_nc_oc=Adk16y364SvELx1xpn5e0llgf3qwZBO4x4FtfOnMU1jGevIJXiNuGGU1rcNZoccQUJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz4P04HeafhbuUiyI4eqJSH3GTmd0I_tUC04vytCzGXtg&oe=69AC11A2"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": 